<span class="line"><span style="color:#61AFEF;">    ├──►</span><span style="color:#98C379;"> CDN（静态资源，全球分发）◄──</span><span style="color:#98C379;"> 源站：Nginx-Static（对象存储OSS/S3）</span></span>
